    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mark Lawlor is proud to bring to the market this spacious detached bungalow tucked away in Corbeagh on the outskirts of Cootehill. The property features bright and generous living accommodation with ample parking. \r\n\r\nComprising of a welcoming entrance hallway with access to a generous living room with solid fuel stove. There is a large open plan kitchen / dining room with solid fuel fireplace. The kitchen is fully equipped and leads to a bright and spacious converted garage ideal for a multitude of uses including a storage room, utility, home gym or further bedroom. The property is completed with three large double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a spacious family bathroom. There is oil fired central heating and double-glazed windows throughout. \r\n\r\nOutside, the property features spacious gardens and a large detached garage. An ideal opportunity for the new owners to put their own stamp on their new home. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\nSituated in Corbeagh on the outskirts of Cootehill Town, the property is a short commute to major employers including Abbott and Manor Farm, while Kingspan in Kingscourt is just short commute further afield. There are a number of local schools, along with a host of sports facilities from a gym to GAA grounds and soccer facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway – 1.47 m x 4.77 m\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway. \r\n\r\nLiving room – 3.69 m x 4.96 m \r\nSpacious living room with solid fuel stove. \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room – 3.67 m x 6.20 m\r\nLarge and fully equipped kitchen / dining room with solid fuel fireplace. \r\n\r\nRoom Off Kitchen  – 2.74 m x 5.16 m \r\nBright and spacious room suitable for a multitude of uses including bedroom, sitting room or utility room. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – 3.36 m x 5.13 m \r\nBright and large double bedroom with built-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 2.85 m x 4.09 m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 3.78 m x 3.86 m\r\nGenerous double bedroom with built-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom – 2.37 m x 2.74 m\r\nLarge bathroom including wash-hand basin, toilet and bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Abundance of outdoor space\r\nClose to all local amenities\r\nSpacious interior\r\nSolid fuel stove\r\nSeparate garage"
      },
